{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1512635-onyx-path-and-gencon-2023","id":1512635,"title":"Onyx Path and Gencon 2023","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-05-24T14:30:23-07:00","id":1512635,"title":"Onyx Path and Gencon 2023","content":"Heya folks, I'm wondering if any fans of the brand or OP itself will be planning to attend and / or run games for Gencon this August? <br /> <br /> For those unaware, it's a pretty massive ttrpg convention that takes place (for some godforsaken reason) in Indiana. But as gaming conventions go it's far and away the biggest in the Midwest US. The d20 crowd holds the vast majority of table real estate, but a lot of game companies use the event to sell merchandise and run games to draw in potential converts.<br /> <br /> Mostly asking because not seeing any Onyx Path games being run on the company or fan side of things. Is Onyx Path planning to attend this year?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://exalted-golden-shackles-iron-crowns.obsidianportal.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://exalted-golden-shackles-iron...dianportal.com</a> Visit Golden Shackles, Iron Crowns; a 3rd Edition Exalted Campaign ongoing since 2014","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2711-janissary87","name":"Janissary87","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2711_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-25T16:13:23-07:00","id":1512788,"title":"","content":"To my knowledge OPP hasn\u2019t been officially at GenCon for a few years now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"us