tachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-05T07:22:00-07:00","id":1513951,"title":"","content":"Thanks for expounding on it, I hadn't realized there was an official statement.<br /> <br /> Unfortunate to hear they won't be doing anything in an official capacity at Gencon, but I guess since no one is running any CoD or Exalted games anyway there's not much interest.<br /> <br /> I hadn't heard of Midwinter before, is it this convention? <a href=\"https://tabletop.events/conventions/midwinter-gaming-convention-2024\" target=\"_blank\">https://tabletop.events/conventions/...onvention-2024</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://exalted-golden-shackles-iron-crowns.obsidianportal.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://exalted-golden-shackles-iron...dianportal.com</a> Visit Golden Shackles, Iron Crowns; a 3rd Edition Exalted Campaign ongoing since 2014","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2711-janissary87","name":"Janissary87","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2711_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-06T11:08:29-07:00","id":1514025,"title":"","content":"That is it. Keep in mind since the Panini the company hasn\u2019t officially been to any conventions and I can\u2019t speak for any future plans regarding Midwinter or any other conventions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"u